  "主要内容": "The fourth-quarter earnings season is approaching, with Factset estimating a 10.5% earnings growth for the S&P 500. All 11 S&P 500 sectors are expected to report earnings growth, with energy likely to be the top performer. Adobe Systems Incorporated (NASDAQ: ADBE) and Finish Line Inc (NASDAQ: FINL) are among the companies set to report early. Adobe, a technology company, is expected to report earnings ahead of the official start of the reporting season. Finish Line Inc, a retail company, is also listed as one of the early reporters. The article outlines the earnings schedule for various sectors in the US market, including Financial Services, Banks, Technology, Transportation, Health Care, Energy, Real Estate, and Retail. Securities explicitly mentioned in the source include Costco Wholesale Corporation (COST), Jabil Inc (JBL), Oracle Corporation (ORCL), Darden Restaurants, Inc. (DRI), FedEx Corporation (FDX), Micron Technology, Inc. (MU), Red Hat Inc (RHT), Bed Bath & Beyond Inc. (BBBY), General Mills, Inc. (GIS), Accenture Plc (ACN), CarMax, Inc (KMX), Hovnanian Enterprises, Inc. (HOV), Paychex, Inc. (PAYX), Nike Inc (NKE).",
